    "text": "<div class=creature>\n<div class=\"bold font-size-h4 bg-title\"><span>{{!!title}}</span><span>18级 杂兵 蛮战</span></div>\n<div class=bg-title><span>中型 异界 野兽（水生，盲目，泥型怪）</span><span>XP {{!!xp}}</span></div>\n<div><span>''HP'' 1；失手攻击无法伤害杂兵</span><span>''先攻'' +13</span></div>\n<div><span>''AC'' 30，''强韧'' 32，''反射'' 30，''意志'' 26</span><span>''侦查'' +14</span></div>\n<div><span>''免疫'' 凝视；''抗力'' 20 强酸</span><span>''感官'' 盲视 10，震动感知 10</span></div>\n<div><span>''速度'' 2，游泳 8</span><span></span></div>\n<div class=\"bold font-size-h4 bg-category\">特性</div>\n<div class=\"bold bg-power\">{{$:/dnd/images/aura}}心灵扰乱</div>\n<div class=description>灵气 1：该灵气内的所有生物获得 5 点心灵易伤。</div>\n<div class=\"bold bg-power\">流体形态</div>\n<div class=description>底栖魔鱼烂泥在水中时隐形。</div>\n<div class=\"bold font-size-h4 bg-category\">标准动作</div>\n<div class=\"bold bg-power\">{{$:/dnd/images/meleebasic}}击打✦随意</div>\n<div class=description>攻击：+20 vs. 强韧<br>命中：16 点伤害，且目标被推动 1 格或迟缓直到该底栖魔鱼烂泥下回合结束。</div>\n<div class=\"bg-power\"><div class=\"ability\"><span>''力量'' 16（+12）</span><span>''敏捷'' 19（+13）</span><span>''感知'' 11（+9）</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"bg-power\"><div class=\"ability\"><span>''体质'' 23（+15）</span><span>''智力'' 4（+6）</span><span>''魅力'' 4（+6）</span></div></div>\n<div><div class=\"ability\"><span>''阵营'' 无</span></div></div>\n</div>",
